WEBVTT

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:47.230
At the border of the Holy Kingdom of Ryoza, the Grand Duke's army and that of the neighboring country, Larza,

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:51.540
have been at war for many years.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:02:00.310
The men in the Grand Duke's army are exhausted from the battle with no foreseen end.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:09.570
They are aggravated by the fact that the people in the Queen's quarter scorn them, despite the fact that they fight for them.

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:36.690
Je, the Founding King who came down from Ephon Noha, brought peace to this land with beast-lords under His command.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:44.550
Yaman Hasal was given the whistle for Touda, and became victorious against Hajan.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:04.000
Song of Grief

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:10.150
What a banquet.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.440
Eat up, Lilan.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.950
Hey, Erin.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.230
Tomura-senpai.

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.430
You were sleeping at a place like this again?

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.940
It's almost noon.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:26.970
Noon?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.410
Oh no!  I have afternoon classes!

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.470
Calm down.

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:33.840
The school's closed today.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:47.750
Seriously, even if you were given permission to keep taking care of Lilan, make some time to eat and sleep.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:53.040
Letting your stomach growl while talking in your sleep isn't something a young girl should do.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:56.450
What?

00:03:56.450 --> 00:04:00.410
It's just, you sound like an old man at times.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.330
"Old man?!"

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:07.620
I appear like that to you guys, eh?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:14.100
Anyway, we swore to protect you and Lilan.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:17.540
Don't force yourself too much and try to rely on others sometimes.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.990
I will.  Thank you very much.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.440
This is the usual package Yuuyan makes, right?

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:31.210
I made it today.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:35.920
Wow!  You can do anything really well.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.670
Yeah, 'cause I'm an old man.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.200
I'm sorry.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:05:04.170
We are still at an advantage, but Larza is coming at us fearlessly,  so we are having great losses of men and Touda.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:09.960
The casualties will return as soon as reinforcements arrive.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:15.040
Necessary doctors will be sent from the Queen's quarter to the palace.

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.930
Not to the battlefield, but to the palace, eh?

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:24.160
What's Shunan doing?

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:29.610
He said he'll be returning to report once the battlefield settles down.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.270
I see.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.730
How should I report the matter to the palace?

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:39.620
We can worry about that later!

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:42.340
I am in command of the battlefield.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:43.820
Step away.

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:44.790
Yes, sir!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.350
Father.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.650
Let me go to the battlefield as well.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:58.380
What?

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:02.210
I would like to exhibit my strength along with my brother.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.510
Just like Yaman Hasal used to.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:08.050
I have Shunan in charge of the war.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:09.820
Step away!

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:12.240
You're too inexperienced to go to war!

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:37.380
You're full of vigor.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:38.430
Ani-ue.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:40.710
So you've returned.

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:44.430
You two return to the palace and report in.

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:45.180
Yes, sir!

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:50.730
Training alone like always?

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.490
It's my custom.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.360
Did something happen with Father again?

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:09.390
I don't think I'd have a chance of survival if I were to be hit by your swing.

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:12.850
You flatter me!  There's no way I'd win against you.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:18.460
That's not true.  You're the strongest man in the Grand Duke's quarter.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.960
Father thinks otherwise.

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:30.140
Father is Father.  He thinks of this country in his own way.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:34.390
He doesn't say anything, but he is in need of your help.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:43.390
I want to support this country with strength and a just heart, like you do.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.360
You never change.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:01.830
<i>There we go.</i>

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:05.440
<i>Ani-ue, does this really become a tree?</i>

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.100
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:06.800
<i>When?</i>

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.950
<i>Maybe when we're adults.</i>

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:12.710
<i>Aww, it's that far away?</i>

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:17.010
<i>Nugan.  This tree is ours.</i>

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:20.690
<i>Right now it's small, but eventually, it'll become a magnificent tree.</i>

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:32.280
<i>By then, I hope to be providing aid for this country and the Queen, like our great ancestor, Yaman Hasal, did.</i>

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.070
<i>Can I become like that, too?</i>

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:38.440
<i>I want to become strong like you, too.</i>

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:41.680
<i>I want to protect this country with you, riding Touda.</i>

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:45.850
<i>Yeah.  We'll protect this country together.</i>

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.500
Nugan.  You've become strong.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:17.680
You're more reliable than a hundred Touda.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:18.860
Ani-ue!

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:22.540
Time moves on and the country changes as well.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:28.670
It's just as important to observe events as they happen, as to protect the country.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:39.440
The path I choose is with you.

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:50.920
Regarding sending the doctors,

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:53.670
I've sent them to the Grand Duke's palace as you ordered.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:02.550
Send some get-well flowers, too.

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:05.000
"Flowers?"

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:11.460
Beautiful flowers will purify the soldiers who return from the battlefield.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:16.620
Outside the country, we never know when the war will end.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:21.310
Inside the country, we never know when the Saigamul will attack the Queen.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:29.360
Ever since what happened during her birthday, the citizens are all frightened.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.970
How worrisome.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.740
The Saigamul...

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:39.430
Will they ever disappear?

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:47.690
They've lived this long, hiding and keeping away from flames of war.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:56.050
The Saigamul feel those with power should become the King.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:01.370
They don't understand the importance of a leader who has a calm, pure heart.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.370
Her Majesty Has Fallen
They don't understand the importance of a leader who has a calm, pure heart.

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:05.210
Her Majesty Has Fallen

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:09.490
And of all things, the Saigamul killed the previous Queen.

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:16.530
We do have the Sezans who protect the Queen, but that's not enough.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:26.380
In order for a flower to maintain its beauty, we must maintain the beauty of the garden.

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:12.720
Shunan-sama.  The messenger from the palace is here.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:19.100
Hello, Shunan-dono.  Well done at the battlefield.

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:21.840
Flowers?

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:25.500
They're symbols of regard from the palace.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.270
Accept them gratefully.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:34.480
Thank you very much.

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:39.590
No!  I don't want to return there anymore!

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:42.430
I'd rather die here if I'm going to go back there!

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.470
Stop this nonsense!

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:51.350
Gee, seriously.  Wajyaku- I mean, citizens from the Grand Duke's quarter are so energetic.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.920
This isn't good.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:03.840
Well anyway, I've delivered the goods to you.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:41.310
Those who are perishing and forgotten about are those who war.

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:55.190
They were sent to the battlefield with friends.

00:13:55.940 --> 00:14:08.240
Honor and pride are our friends in war.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:22.030
Become frightened and the sun sets.

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:28.370
Wajyaku.  Wajyaku.

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:35.080
We fight under the banner of the Grand Duke.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:41.270
Wajyaku.  Wajyaku.

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:52.770
Some day, hear the words of our cries.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:03.300
We're at an advantage, but if the war continues, our casualties will only increase.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:09.270
The soldiers sent out are exhausted to the point that honor and money can't refresh them.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:12.080
I do not want to cause any more pain to them!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:17.340
That is why we must end this war soon!

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:19.700
Being defensive won't get us anywhere.

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:24.050
We'll march into Larza and make them fall to the ground!

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:35.810
Those guys from the Queen's quarter... no, those <i>Holons</i> just don't understand!

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:43.400
We protect a pure Queen who is the descendant of the gods and enriches the country.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:46.810
Father!  I cannot permit those words to pass my ears!

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:49.660
Have you forgotten to have a heart of loyalty toward the Queen?

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:51.890
Nugan.

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:53.870
Step away, Nugan!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:57.100
You don't understand anything about this country.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:16:01.270
Father, it is our role to do the dirty work!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.780
That's enough!

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:04.540
I can't even have a conversation with you!

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:09.950
Father!

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:27.360
Ani-ue!

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:29.720
Why did you stop me?!

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:38.150
Nugan, you probably have yet to understand that both Holon and Wajyaku are only humans.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:43.660
That's where the distortion is in this country.

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:57.170
The Queen is also human, just like us!

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:00.100
Have you gone mad, Ani-ue?

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:06.940
To call the Queen, the descendant of our gods, a human like us!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:12.280
Nugan,  I want to fix this country.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.220
That is unnecessary!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:17.470
The way it is now, is how this country should be.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.190
At this rate, this country will end!

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:24.290
I will change this country before that happens!

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:26.390
Nugan.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:51.190
Ani-ue, do you remember the promise we made the day we planted this tree?

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:53.490
Of course.

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:06.540
Ever since, I've always dreamed of walking the same path as you.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:15.080
I shared that dream with you.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.560
Won't you change how you feel?

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:28.070
To unify the country which has separated into two, without using force...

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:29.760
that is the future I seek!

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:31.630
It's the path I choose!

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:45.250
Then I too, shall follow my ideals!

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:47.810
Nugan.

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:34.530
Why, Ani-ue?

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:37.180
You were always correct!

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:42.700
You always showed me the path, strongly and clearly!

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.770
<i>Force won't do.</i>

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.070
Yet, why?!

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:58.980
I always knew what your ideal is.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:03.980
But I must go!

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.790
<i>We'll do it together.</i>

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.480
Ani-ue!

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:39.900
Nugan!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:53.080
I can't allow myself to be stopped!

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:10.100
I will no longer hesitate.

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:19.490
The whirlpool of time even splits the paths which brothers take.

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:26.580
At a place Erin didn't yet know, the world was starting to change greatly.

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.440
We got yelled at by Karisa-san again, didn't we?

00:24:04.440 --> 00:24:06.440
She's scary, that old lady.

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:10.070
At this rate, we'll never be more than
greenhorns in training.

00:24:10.070 --> 00:24:13.210
We will succeed in this shopping
endeavor, no matter what!

00:24:13.210 --> 00:24:14.830
Right, gotta work hard!

00:24:14.830 --> 00:24:17.290
All right, Mokku.  Don't drop the money.

00:24:17.290 --> 00:24:19.680
You're the one who has the money.

00:24:19.680 --> 00:24:20.440
What?

00:24:20.440 --> 00:24:21.400
Huh?

00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:25.050
Kenomo no Souja Erin.  The Two Go Out Shopping.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:24:30.030
The Two Go Out Shopping
